          "kind": "standard",
          "definition": "Safety practices to prevent contact with another person's blood and body fluids, such as wearing disposable gloves, using face masks, washing hands before and after giving first aid, and disposing of contaminated materials properly.",
          "answers": null,
          "position": 19,
          "id": "beb0a325-b7d1-4901-a453-e06d321fe3b5"
        }
